+From: OpenWrt TB-RK3399ProD port
+Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: rockchip: build Toybrick TB-RK3399ProD DTB
+
+Build the TB-RK3399ProD DTB with its PCIe host enabled.
+
+---
+ arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/Makefile | 1 +
+ 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)
+
